   <h1>ORTHOPEDIC SHOES FOR HEEL PAIN<\/h1>\n    <p>Take control of your foot pain and find the right supportive shoes that offer all-day comfort. Vionic shoes and orthotic shoe insoles have been proven to alleviate heel pain and support natural alignment. Wearing the wrong shoe can have long-lasting effects and result in pain or discomfort in your heel bone, preventing you from enjoying your daily walks and other activities. Whether you are looking for athletic shoes to get your steps in or comfortable sandals for a beach day, our online collection has the best shoes for ultimate foot care. Don't let plantar fasciitis pain or a sore heel stop you from staying active.<\/p>\n    <div id=\"moreText\">\n        <h1>SAY GOODBYE TO FOOT PAIN AND HELLO TO ARCH SUPPORT<\/h1>\n        <p>If you're looking for shoes for heel pain, look no further. Here at Vionic, we have shoes for plantar fasciitis, achilles tendonitis, or any other heel pain you may be suffering from. Thanks to our Vio Motion technology, we can help relieve pain while providing the arch support you need to stand on your feet all day. Pairing orthopedic shoes with the realignment of the lower leg to its natural angle will reduce the pulling and strain on the plantar fascia or achilles tendon. This can help relieve a common cause of heel pain and reduce the aggravation of heel spurs. Find supportive shoes from Vionic that provide support, comfort, and style, and enjoy gradual pain relief with our breakthrough cushioning technology.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <button id=\"readMoreBtn\" onclick=\"toggleText()\">Read More<\/button>\n\n    <script>\n        function toggleText() {\n            const moreText = document.getElementById(\"moreText\");\n            const btn = document.getElementById(\"readMoreBtn\");\n\n            if (moreText.style.display === \"none\") {\n                moreText.style.display = \"block\";\n                btn.textContent = \"Read Less\";\n            } else {\n                moreText.style.display = \"none\";\n                btn.textContent = \"Read More\";\n            }\n        }\n    <\/script>\n\n<\/body>","setwidth":"full","padding":false,"col_center":false,"bgsection":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","rangebg":0,"bgbefore":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","e_size":"auto","e_repeat":"no-repeat"}},"advanced_content_rBNrNn":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"html_VnjrGJ":{"type":"html","settings":{"code":"<body>\n\n\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Footer<\/title>\n    <style>\n        \/* Main footer styling *\/\n        .footer {\n            background-color: #333;\n            color: #fff;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            padding: 20px;\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        .footer-section {\n            flex: 1;\n            margin: 0 10px;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        .footer-section h2 {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .footer-section p {\n            font-size: 14px;\n            margin: 5px 0;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n        .footer-section a {\n            color: #8FA19A;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            margin-top: 10px;\n            display: inline-block;\n        }\n\n        .footer-section form {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            border: 1px solid #8FA19A;\n        }\n\n        .footer-section input[type=\"email\"] {\n            padding: 10px;\n            border: none;\n            flex: 1;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            color: #333;\n        }\n\n        .footer-section button {\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            background-c